  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Empoderando a la Juventud en Monterrey</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Youth in Monterrey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Bajo este programa, Alianza Heartland ampl&#xED;a los programas educativos y recreativos para j&#xF3;venes en riesgo de 6 a 18 a&#xF1;os a trav&#xE9;s de centros comunitarios y brinda servicios psicosociales y de salud mental grupales e individuales a j&#xF3;venes y familias afectados por la violencia dom&#xE9;stica y de pandillas. La iniciativa se desarrolla en cinco comunidades del &#xE1;rea metropolitana de Monterrey, beneficiando a 6,000 j&#xF3;venes y 2,000 padres de familia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this program, Alianza Heartland expands educational and recreational programs for at-risk youth ages 6-18 through community centers and provides group and individual mental health and psychosocial services to youth and families affected by gang and domestic violence. The initiative takes place in five communities in the Monterrey metropolitan area, benefitting 6,000 youth and 2,000 parents.</narrative>
  </description>
